[[File:Jelly icon.png|left]]
'''Warped jellies''' are stronger variants of [[Jelly|jellies]] that require level 52 [[Slayer]] to kill. They are found exclusively within the [[Catacombs of Kourend]], both southern and eastern. Warped jellies count towards a Jellies [[Slayer task]], but they do not count towards a [[Slayer task/Warped creatures|Warped creatures]] [[Slayer task]].

Jellies attack with [[magical melee]], so armour with high magic defence is recommended, such as [[Karil's armour]] or [[black dragonhide armour]]. Like their lower levelled counterparts, using [[Protect from Melee]] will prevent all damage from them. Warped jellies in the eastern chamber can be [[safespotted]] using the water in the south-east corner of the chamber. They can either be attacked across the body of water, or around the two corners.

Players looking to kill warped jellies as quickly as possible may do so through the use of [[Aoe|AOE]] attacks like [[Chinchompa|chinchompas]] and/or [[Ice Barrage]], especially on a Slayer task. Alternatively, ranged gear and a [[venator bow]] can be used as a low-effort method for gathering [[Clue scroll (hard)|hard clues]] relatively quickly.

